# Vendored upstream patches — READMEs reference compare URLs and docs.rs
# badges that drift independently of our tree (pre-existing 404s for
# webview2-com-sys version-compare links). Treat as archival, mirroring
# the policy already applied to `crates/.*` and `scripts/.*`.
