# wravery/webview2-rs compare URLs that 404 because upstream restructured tag layout.
# We don't control the vendored content; ignore the specific 404 paths.
https://github\.com/wravery/webview2-rs/compare/.*
# Nature.com uses cookie-auth redirects; lychee trips on the chain despite 200 final status
.*nature\.com/.*

# opencontainers.org returns transient connection failures from GitHub Actions runners
.*opencontainers\.org/.*

# slavakurilyak.com personal blog returns 301 redirect; lychee hits max-redirects limit but link is valid
.*slavakurilyak\.com/.*

